## Contents and safe import

work-plan.csv contains the complete plan snapshot, not file bytes. manifest.json identifies each resource, SHA-256, MIME type and exact project/phase associations. Phase-only resources are included; unrelated Library files are excluded.

Import work-plan.csv only into the matching ProjectId and current BaseRevision. Omitted records require explicit replace confirmation. A stale import returns 409: reload and reconcile rather than overwrite. Workflow closure still requires the authorized approval, merge or push evidence.

The resources directory is reference material, not an executable package or a resource-import command. This archive contains no credentials.
